    "scenesThatPass": [
      "AUNT FRANCES: All she knew was that she was alone. And her baby nearly drowned in Maria's bitter tears.\nKYLIE: Is that where the curse started?",
      "AUNT FRANCES: But unlike Gillian, Sally could never fully accept that we are different.\nSALLY: Just ignore them.\nSALLY: Gilly, come on.\nGILLIAN: Boo. Aren't you scared I'm gonna cast a spell on you?",
      "SALLY: Gilly, what if you die before me?\nGILLIAN: No way. We're gonna get old and live together like the aunts. We're gonna die on the same day.\nSALLY: Promise?\nGILLIAN: Swear.",
      "GILLIAN: Heads up. Weirdo at 12 o'clock.\nLOVELORN: Get off me. You make me sick.\nLOVELORN: Where are they? Where are those twisted hags?",
      "AUNT JET: Oh, dear.\nFRANCES: It's your turn.\nAUNT JET: No. No, I handled the school teacher. It's definitely your turn."
    ]
